<title>UK: Arkaig raises $850 mln via collateralised FRN - JPM.</title>
<headline>Arkaig raises $850 mln via collateralised FRN - JPM.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following collateralised floating-rate issue was announced by sole lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ARKAIG FINANCE CO BV</p>
<p> AMT ** $775 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  * 19.MAR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +6 BP     PAY DATE    18.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 ISS PRICE  99.962    FULL FEES   NONE</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   GROSS UP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** ALSO 81 MLN SFR TRANCHE, 3ML+4BP AT 99.96,</p>
<p>10 MLN ECU, 3ML+3BP, AT PAR AND 15 MLN DFL, 3ML+6BP AT 99.98.</p>
<p>	    * ALL NOTES CALLABLE AT PAR ON 18.JUN.98</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
